  "prefLabel": "Plu 301.06 Water treatment technician",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 301.06 “Water treatment technician” means “water treatment technician” as defined in RSA 329-A:2, VII, namely, “any person who installs, maintains or repairs water treatment systems.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Plu 301) #8981, eff 9-20-07",
